{"games":[{"id":23380021,"name":"Military Base Tycoon [SAVES PROGRESS]","desc":"Build up your Military Base! A classic Tycoon: gain in-game Cash with Droppers, eliminating Soldiers🔫, collecting Cash Crates💵 and achieving Milestones! ⚔️And fight with other players⚔️, or team up🏳️! Don't worry about leaving, your progress saves!\n\nIf you enjoy the game, please leave a LIKE!👍\n\nAnnoyed of people oofing you or experiencing lag? Use the FREE Private Server!\n\nDon't forget to check my group👪, Legacy Tycooning at: https://www.roblox.com/groups/12656581/Legacy-Tycooning. If you join this group you receive a bonus💰 $ 1 000 in-game once every Rebirth and a free Dropper on the second floor of your Tycoon!\n\nPremium benefits: get a bonus💰 $ 2 000 once every Rebirth and a regenerating Coin which gives free Cash in-game periodically!\n\nPatch Notes🛠️: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/military-base-tycoon-patch-notes\n\nAgain, you can really help me out by leaving a LIKE👍 and drop a FAVORITE⭐ if you had fun playing the game! Thank you for playing!","path":"/game/23380021-military-base-tycoon","slug":"23380021-military-base-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/dea1979b3d189c648fc81b9672a3a6efdad1037ed393223383816c10fc684d97.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-42845932c96e9a87da69d71b484769fc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":84124729,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-25T21:12:03.633Z","creator":{"name":"Blafert","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":156220906,"name":"🔨⛵Whatever Floats your Boat","desc":"Whatever Floats your Boat is a game about building a new boat and then testing your design against others. With motors, weapons, and other interactive items, you'll never know what kind of crazy antics are going to unfold. ⛵ Need help? Checkout the Whatever Floats your Boat wiki! See in game changelog (under settings) for more!\n\nCan you survive?","path":"/game/156220906-whatever-